## 0) How in-zone order works today (read this turn)
Play order is computed, not file order. Spec :223: at most 2 faith cards per run, skip fill cards, one easy opener, up to 2 review cards, then written personal:true cards, then never-seen cards by fewest English words, then seen-longest-ago. Spec :222 drops one meta.outings card in after the opener. Spec :226 puts 5 pic cards per scene and plays no-pic cards between scenes.
No location or sub-group field exists. Cards have no zone field (zone = id prefix, spec :351). The only sub-place today is spec :227's hotel front desk scene (ms-03 to ms-06 and ms-21 to ms-23).
Result: almost every bh and ms card is personal:true, so file order does not drive play. Reordering cards alone changes nothing on screen.
