M6 Hotel stay, Nancy a guest (5): ms-06 One night is one hundred twenty dollars. / ms-03 Welcome to our hotel. / ms-28 Your room is ready. / ms-05 Breakfast is at seven thirty. / ms-04 Check-out is at eleven. (Same order as hotel-steps-20261102-0732 PLAN.md; its wording work stays there. Its 1B ms-33 "I need more towels." would go after ms-28.)
