X8 bh-26 "Take this pill." is the nurse's voice on a picture card, so it's something she hears. Fits Recovery. Keep.
X9 Faith cap: M5 has 3 faith cards and M3 has 2, with a limit of 2 per run, so Church shows only part of itself each run. Keep. It's a loose guide.
X10 Kitchen and fair lines play in the home room set (spec :227). Keep, per Maxwell.
